window.products.push({"id":698031,"name":"TimeDegree Kitchen Soap Dispenser, Touchless Soap Dispenser Equipped with Infrared Motion Sensor，Hand Sanitizer Dispenser with Adjustable Switches, Su","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QIKoFgGJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHO studies have shown that most viruses and bacteria are transmitted by hand, so improving hand hygiene is particularly important. Therefore, it is very important for people to have a good soap dispenser. With this automatic soap dispenser, you don't have to touch a common soap box full of bacteria any more. This will help to keep the distance between your home and the surrounding environment, avoid secondary cross infection, and make you and your children love to wash hands and clean hands more safely at the same time. Adjust the Amount of Soap: Turn on: press the \"on\" key for 2-3 seconds, the red light flashes twice and is always on Increase liquid volume: short press the \"+\" button once to increase the liquid output Reduce liquid volume: short press the button \"-\" once to reduce the liquid output Off: press the \"off\" key for 2-3 seconds, and the red light will flash until the indicator light goes out It is suggested that the liquid volume should be controlled between 1.5 ml - 3 ml. Specifications: Material: Stainless steel PC / ABS plastic Capacity: 280 ml / 9.56 oz Product Dimensions: 7.89 × 4.09 × 3.50 in Sensor Range: 0 - 6 cm / 0 - 2.36 in Dispensing Volume: 1.5 ml - 3.5 ml Power Supply: 4 × New AAA Batteries (Not Included) Warm tips: In order to get a better product experience, please keep the two intelligent infrared motion sensors clean, please do not use too thick soap. Or if the thick liquid is poured out, add appropriate amount of dilution water to ensure normal dispense. Noticed that the infrared sensor may fail when it is used in strong light environment. Packages Included: 1 × Automatic Soap Dispenser  1 × Waterproof Base 1 × User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QIKoFgGJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TimeDegree","source_asin":"B087QY1P4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087QY1P4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087QY1P4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
