window.products.push({"id":698164,"name":"LIDYUK End Table with Charging Station, Narrow Side Table with Drawer and USB Ports & Power Outlets, Nightstand Bedside Tables for Small Spaces, Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710ylwv2kDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE TOP WITH BIGGER USABLE AREA - Compared to similar products, LIDYUK end table has the power outlet moved to the front vertical side, and its top panel extends around to maximize usable area, giving you a large, smooth desktop. WITH A LARGER & DEEPER DRAWER - You want a mini drawer? No, you don't! LIDYUK side table with a larger and deeper drawer measures 8.2 x 4.6 x 13.4 inches, which you can store more stuff or larger items. THE SECOND DIVIDER IS HIGHER, PERFECT FOR BIG ITEMS - Have you ever felt that each shelf level is too short to hold some tall items? This end table meets your needs very well. The distance between the top and the drawer is 11.2 inches, which is high enough for taller items. WELL-CONSIDERED ON USER SAFETY - The charging station is designed on the front vertical side, which is safer to use. You don’t have to worry about electric shock caused by spilled coffee, water, etc. LIDYUK side table with charging station is well-considered on user safety. IT'S SO HANDY FOR THOSE WHO SPEND A LOT OF TIME ON THEIR PHONE IN BED - Low battery where is power outlet? No need to look around it’s within your arm’s reach. Also, the electrical cord is 6.5 ft long, enough to keep you away from wall corner where the home power outlet located. WHAT TO DD IF SOME ACCESSORIES ARE MISSING: Before assembling this side table, please check if all the accessories are included in the package, if some accessories are missing, please contact us first and we will send you the parts for replacement at free, you don't have to take it apart and return it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710ylwv2kDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIDYUK","source_asin":"B0C3QLX5FX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3QLX5FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3QLX5FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
