window.products.push({"id":698201,"name":"Money Tree Gift Holder - Colorful Light Gift Card Tree Display for Birthday with 12 Clips, 1.8ft Tall Photo Cash Lottery Ticket Holder Unique Desktop ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819DWZl-y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Rich Functional Modes] Money tree holder has 17 kinds of lighting colors, such as warm white, hot red, light green and other colors. 7 dynamic lighting modes, suitable for different occasions and different groups of people. There is also an automatic cycle timing function, 4H/6H/8H optional. [Ultra Long USB Cable]: The cable is about 6.6 feet long. Plug the cable directly into the base to turn on the lights. The light mode can be adjusted with the button on the USB. The lights can also be adjusted using the remote control. Tips: When using the remote control, please unplug the USB cable first, and point the remote control at the signal receiver in the USB interface. [Premium Material] This gift card tree holder is made of high quality plastic, which is durable. The strengthened branches are stable and strong. After the upgrade, the design of the star clip is unique, and the clip is more firm. The overall usage time is longer. [Diverse Usage Scenarios] Birthday and Christmas wishes can be presented with these money photos gift cards and tree holder to express your feelings. Can be used to hold photos, greeting cards, gift cards, mini candies, and other gifts. Perfect for holiday parties, Valentine's Day, Christmas, wedding anniversaries, birthdays, weddings, housewarmings, or everyday home decor. [Package Includes] Money lottery ticket tree holder includes a birch tree branch lamp (trunk height 14 inches) and its base, 12 star clips, 1 * 6.6ft USB cable, 1 remote control with battery, and instruction manual. There are 24 colorful synchronized LED lights on the branches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819DWZl-y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beeplove","source_asin":"B09XMG2V2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XMG2V2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XMG2V2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
