window.products.push({"id":698337,"name":"Superior 100% Brushed Microfiber Duvet Cover Set, King/California King, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yTQH5aqoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"***Impressions is now Superior brand*** Affordable Luxury Linens Experience the best in affordable luxury with these Brushed Microfiber Duvet Cover Sets. Add a chic finishing touch and a pop of color to your bedroom with this essential design, perfect in the master suite or guest room. The rich hues instantly liven up the appearance of a room. Made from premium microfiber polyester, this duvet cover set is high quality, soft, and wrinkle resistant. The soft brushed finish enhances the texture for a classic look, and the hidden button closure is a perfect finishing touch.  This gorgeous duvet bedding set can be machine washed and tumble dried low for a thorough and easy cleaning. Available in multiple sizes and colors, letting you choose the one that best suits your bedroom. It is an ideal accompaniment for modern and contemporary home décors. Complete your bedroom décor with coordinating sheet set, pillowcase set, and bed skirt for a plush, put together look. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: “The feel of this cover is soooo soft and just what we wanted!” “Very good quality, comfortable and great price! I can't really say anything bad about this. It looks great on the bed, and fits very well over my duvet. Easily removable for washing. Feels soft and snuggly. Very pleased with purchase” “This is the most amazing Duvet Cover I have ever found. The fabric is soft as silk with a slight sheen and a feel that you will fall in love with” “after I slept under this cover I would never consider buying anything else. This duvet cover is so soft and comfortable, no joke I describe it as sleeping on a cloud of awesomeness... I love this product and hate getting out of bed now! Would definitely buy again!!” “I would definitely recommend!!! I will definitely be purchasing another one for my spare bedroom when it's done!” And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yTQH5aqoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B008TKLGSI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TKLGSI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TKLGSI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
