window.products.push({"id":698418,"name":"Vintage Dictionary Art Print –USA Anatomical Heart – 8 x 10 inches – Upcycled Art Abstract Prints Wall Art for Home Decor Wall Decorations For Living ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1guSMHUOFL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: Upcycled, vintage art It’s not every say you say a cool USA Anatomical Heart ! Each one of our art pieces is printed directly onto actual dictionary pages from the early 1900’s. With over hundred years of history behind them just imagine the journey these pages have taken. The colors chosen for the USA Anatomical Heart are stunning and really complement the printed background. It’s a striking piece that has serious impact. Unique prints every time As the base for our art is vintage dictionary pages, each one is different. Chosen at random, the pages are unique meaning, no two pieces are the same. For this reason, the dictionary art you receive will differ slightly from the image featured. We print dictionary pages with art directly in our studio. Mat included To protect your vintage dictionary art prints when in transit they will be packed with a backing mat but no frame. On receipt of your stunning artwork you have the freedom to buy your own frame which represents your style and décor. A conversation starter Art is subjective, wherever you hang your art you will be sure to create a discussion about it. Suitable for anywhere, whether it be kitchen art, living room art, hallway art, office art, studio art or bedroom art, the possibilities are endless. It also makes a great gift for a friend or family member who loves modern style art with a vintage twist. A suitable gift for male or female art lovers, the recipient will be sure to love it! Measuring just 8 x 10 inches it will be suitable for even the smallest of rooms. Vintage dictionary print range Have you seen our other dictionary art design pieces? We have an entire range of pieces, all printed directly onto early 1900 dictionary pages. With so many designs to choose from you’ll be spoilt for choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1guSMHUOFL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vintage Dictionary Art Prints","source_asin":"B0764JDWSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0764JDWSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0764JDWSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
