window.products.push({"id":698475,"name":"Mamibot W200 SkyBot Cordless Window Cleaner Robot Vacuum with Remote Control, Up to 90 Mins Working Time Glass Cleaning Tools with Strong Auto Suction","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WVCSH8WrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【wireless design & long work time】Mamibot W200 SKYBOT is a cordless design, without cable restriction, also no longer to establish a connection to the power supply unit, so it's more convenient to use with various occasions. Window washing robot is built in 3350mAh battery, which running time of up to 90 minutes after full charge for more tasks. The independent battery is removable for charging anytime, anywhere. The W200 SkyBot runs out of electricity, the UPS work time ups to 30-40 mins. 【Intelligent edge detection Technology】Mamibot W200 SKYBOT have intelligent Edge detection Technology and an advanced powerful suction fan function, which are provide double edge protection for frameless glass cleaning. W200 SkyBot have 4 Sensors and it can automatically recognizes window frames and adapts its direction in time to optimize its cleaning patterns. Capable of cleaning various kinds of windows, including framed, frameless, colored, decaled glass or French window. 【Easy to Operate】 W200 SKYBOT is a intelligent high-end window cleaning robot with security system, intelligent cleaning path planning. One push to start and stop, the AI algorithm plans the most intelligent cleaning path. The window washer can be controlled with a remote control within a maximum of 20 meters as the crow flies. When the cleaning is complete, it will automatically return to the starting point. It's the best gift for your friends, family and loved ones. 【Safety】For all-round safe cleaning, double safety protection, safe and free in all directions, a safety rope with 1.5 m wire to attach your W200 SkyBot to the inner bracket, a cupula with 2.5 m extension cable to hold the robot stick on glass for cleaning in all directions.The multi-level security concept of the W200 SkyBot offers intelligent solutions for all situations, so that cleaning tall windows is completely harmless and uncomplicated. 【Guarantee Service】24h Contact Customer Service and one year free guarantee. If the W200 does not move, please check the surface of the window glass for excessive wear, fractures or too thick dust. In this case, please first clean the windows manually and reset the machine. Please read the product manual carefully before using the machine. To avoid the loss due to the long-term storage of the lithium battery, please recharge the battery completely and store it if the device is not used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WVCSH8WrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mamibot","source_asin":"B09K42GY4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K42GY4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K42GY4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
