window.products.push({"id":698613,"name":"Chulkurs 11\" Carbon Steel Wok Pan, No Chemical Woks and Stir Fry Pans, Flat Bottom Chinese Wok with Detachable Wooden Handle for all Stoves (11\", Wok)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yqzYqHfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TIPS】: Require seasoning before use!! This is an iron wok without any chemical coating, it is normal to be rust. Re-seasoned if it is rusty. Cleaning in time(coating with some cooking oil after cleaning) and keeping it dry can reduce rust. Please give the wok some patience, maintenance for a period of time (almost a month or so), the more you use it, the easier it gets. 【DURABLE&PRACTICAL】: This 11\" stir frying wok is made of high quality carbon steel, which is durable and easy to heat. Reasonably designed size and weight, using thicker materials, but not cumbersome, women can operate with one hand easily, and capacity are suitable for cooking for a family of 2-3 people. 【HEALTHIER WAY TO COOK】: The surface of the wok is nitriding processed, and is free of chemical coating and PFOA to ensure a healthy diet. So the carbon steel wok is durable than the coated pan. Although it is not a non-stick pan, it will become physical non-stick during the repeatedly seasoning process. 【A POT OF MUTI-PURPOSE】: This flat bottom wok pan is suitable for Deep-frying, Braising, Stir-frying and Steaming on Electric, Induction and Gas stoves to satisfy your daily needs of making various Asian cuisines. Please remove the detachable wooden handle and lid before placing in the oven. 【1-YEAR AFTER SERVICE】: If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase for any reason, please reach out and we will attempt to resolve any issues and ensure your contentment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yqzYqHfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHULKURS","source_asin":"B09H5NJ83P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5NJ83P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5NJ83P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
