window.products.push({"id":698748,"name":"ABYstyle Dragon Ball Z Kakarot Heroes 4 Shot Glasses 1.5 Oz. Featuring Goku, Gohan, Piccolo and Trunks DBZ Anime Manga Drinkware Home Essentials Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PO0pY-TXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Step into the thrilling world of Dragon Ball Z: Kakarot and unleash your inner warrior with the extraordinary Heroes Shot Glass Set. Defending the Earth from the relentless forces of evil demands unwavering commitment and an unyielding spirit. Brace yourself, as this set of shot glasses serves as your vessel for an exhilarating journey into the Dragon Ball Z universe. Prepare to be amazed as the essence of Goku, Gohan, Piccolo, and Trunks is intricately captured in this exquisite Heroes Shot Glass Set. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, each glass showcases a vibrant and color-coordinated design, paying homage to the unique qualities and personalities of these beloved characters. Immerse yourself in the aura of Goku's unwavering determination, Gohan's untapped potential, Piccolo's stoic strength, and Trunks' gallant resolve with every sip. The Heroes Shot Glass Set is more than just a collection of drinking vessels; it serves as a symbol of your devotion to the Dragon Ball Z: Kakarot universe. Take a moment to appreciate the expert craftsmanship that brings these characters to life. From Goku's iconic orange gi to Gohan's resolute expression, every minute detail is meticulously crafted, allowing you to connect with the essence of these legendary heroes on a profound level. Experience the energy and power of Dragon Ball Z: Kakarot as you raise a toast to the indomitable spirit of these iconic characters. The versatility of this set extends beyond its role as shot glasses. Display them proudly in your home or use them as decorative accents, showcasing your admiration for Dragon Ball Z: Kakarot and serving as conversation starters among fellow fans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PO0pY-TXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABYstyle","source_asin":"B0B5VMJZKL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5VMJZKL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5VMJZKL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
