window.products.push({"id":698775,"name":"New York Botanical Garden by Chesapeake Bay Candle Decorative 2-Wick Jar with Lid, Red Maple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oXLtOTdfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The New York Botanical Garden by Chesapeake Bay Candle Decorative 2-Wick Jar with Lid, includes botanical scents and designs inspired by the grounds, architecture, and rare illustrated works of The New York Botanical Garden. The Red Maple fragrance is inspired by the Maple Collection. Fall has arrived with comforting scents of warm praline, maple, and cinnamon, infusing the autumn landscape. The distinguished collection of maple trees fill the air with earthy notes of cedarwood, oak moss, and patchouli as colorful shades of red, orange, and yellow leaves dance amongst the branches. As candle burns, hand wrapped paper adorned with signature New York Botantical Garden artworl is exposed and the beauty of the artwork is celebrated from the inside out. With 9 fragrances/illustrations available, the candle celebrates the exceptional beauty and unique artistry of the Garden's rare archival holdings, and shares, through fragrance, the magnificent botanticals found in its diverse, living collections. The New York Botanical Garden (NYBG) is an iconic living museum, a major educational institution, and a scientific organization operating one of the world’s largest plant research and conservation programs. Integral to this initiative are the rare archival collections of the Garden’s LuEsther T. Mertz Library, which contain illustrated works dating back as far as the 12th century. Chesapeake Bay Candle has partnered with The New York Botanical Garden on a finely fragranced collection to celebrate the exceptional beauty and unique artistry of the Garden’s rare archival holdings, and to share with consumers, through fragrance, the magnificent botanicals found in its diverse living collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oXLtOTdfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesapeake Bay Candle","source_asin":"B00XFYXMLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XFYXMLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XFYXMLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
