window.products.push({"id":698828,"name":"Christmas Tree Ornaments - 67mm/2.625\" Designer Glass Balls from Christmas by Krebs - Handmade Seamless Hanging Holiday Decorations for Trees - Set of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aBmYwGnAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRULY THE BEST: We create the highest quality handmade Christmas tree ornaments in classical balls with silvered or aluminized glass and vibrant colors. Each of these sets features 8 pieces at 2 and 5/8\" large (67mm). Our ornaments are sure to be a holiday favorite and capture the wonder of Christmas. DESIGNER SELECTION: We carefully create colors to accentuate the style of your Christmas decorations and give a nice classic timeless feeling of elegance. We create sets of Xmas balls made to capture memories and festive fun in your home for a lifetime. COLORFUL PRESENTATION: Each of our ornaments gives an explosion of festive solid color because we carefully silver or aluminize the inside of each ornament to give our designer colors the chance to shine. Each of our baubles is complete with a filigree topper and loop for hooks and hanging. HANDMADE CRAFTSMANSHIP: Our ornaments are made in the USA and Mexico by skilled artisans. We use molten glass to create seamless balls for true artisan quality. We give you the finest elegant antique quality Christmas tree decorations. CHRISTMAS BY KREBS: We have been creating perfect Christmas memories one ornament at a time for over 70 years by keeping fine handmade artisanal glass ornaments alive. We bring the best possible quality to your holiday decorations and accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aBmYwGnAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christmas By Krebs","source_asin":"B0BM5B9Z2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM5B9Z2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM5B9Z2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":698829,"name":"Stainless Steel Soup Spoons (8 pack), Great for Soup, Cereal, Ice Cream & More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rhh6zMzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 11) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rhh6zMzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Procan","source_asin":"B01A14I8KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A14I8KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A14I8KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
