window.products.push({"id":698963,"name":"NOVICA Decorative Large Batik On Cotton Wall Mural, Green 'Impress'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FWmxsNcGL._AC_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Fascinated with the art and legendary elegance of ancient Lanna culture, Alaya Cholprasertsuk presents a portrait of a young woman enjoying a leisurely day in a banana grove. Wearing nothing but a flower in her hair, she smiles as a butterfly lands on her fingers. Batik techniques on cotton create this colorful and expressive work, which comes framed in rain tree wood. - Arrives framed About our Artist: Thai artisan Alaya Cholprasertsuk was introduced to the arts at a very young age. She loves to design batik with earth tones. She admires dull colors, which tell about her simple, easy, and free character. She enjoys mixing colors and creating her own tones. 'This craft is my pride and my life and I think I have found my way,' she says.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FWmxsNcGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0082HCYE8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082HCYE8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082HCYE8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
