window.products.push({"id":698972,"name":"Now Designs Basic Cotton Kitchen Chef's Apron, Gnome Sweet Gnome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WvdsXOT-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For 50 years, Now Designs has created kitchen textiles, table linens and accessories that are consistently recognized for superior colors, trends, design and unsurpassed quality and workmanship. This unisex Basic Kitchen Apron is a beloved classic by Now Designs and is truly a workhorse in the kitchen. It is made from heavy-weight 100 percent cotton and woven on an oversized loom making it 6 inches wider than other aprons to help provide the perfect fit. This chef's apron is designed to fit men and women: it ties at the waist and features an adjustable neck strap for comfort. Stress points have been bar-tacked for extra durability and the deep front pocket is great for tucking away recipe cards, tea towels, trivets and utensils. This attention to detail ensures that a Now Designs Basic Cotton Apron is sure to be a consistent kitchen companion for years to come. Care: Machine wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WvdsXOT-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B06VW5J1W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06VW5J1W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06VW5J1W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":698973,"name":"62PCS Wheat Straw Dinnerware Sets for 4, Reusable Unbreakable Dinnerware Set for Kids Adults, Microwave Safe, Lightweight Camping Plates Cups and Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717wglrgylL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀【WHEAT STRAW DINNERWARE SET】You will get a beautiful dinnerware set including 4 plates, 4 bowls, 4 cups, 4 fruit plates, 4 sets of cutlery and various fruit picks with cute messages (30 pieces). Everything are packaged in a classical gift box. This set is super lightweight, easy to clean and unbreakable! Beautiful and durable enough for everyday use, camping and outdoor travel. The 4 beautiful color combinations are like a work of art, and it will remind you of a beautiful fall day. 🍀【NATURAL & SUSTAINABLE WHEAT STRAW MATERIAL】This unbreakable dinnerware set is made of good quality, BPA-free natural wheat straw and food grade PP. They are sturdy and durable to last for many years. If you are tired of using disposable dinnerware sets for outdoor parties and trips, If you would like to reduce plastic waste when you're on the go, Our sustainable dinnerware sets are a great alternative. 🍀【UNBREAKABLE & LIGHTWEIGHT】These sturdy and sustainable dinnerware won't shatter like glassware. No more worrying about broken or dropped dishes! These dinnerware are light, just like paper plates, which is very friendly to children and older people. This dinnerware definitely help with many sensory issues one might experience with traditional silverware, such as the annoying clanking sounds that comes from those silverware clashes. 🍀【PREMIUM DINNERWARE FOR HOME & OUTDOOR ACTIVITIES】This dinnerware set is durable, lightweight, sturdy and unbreakable. Perfect for camper/travel trailer/RV. The plates and bowls are full size so they can hold a lot of food. They stack nicely and won't take up a lot of room. Raised edges of the plates can keep liquids from running off the edges of the food. Each utensil has a fun box so they can be kept clean as they are transported from indoors to outdoors, etc. 🍀【MICROWAVE, DISHWASHER SAFE & EASY TO CLEAN】These dinnerware sets are made out of wheat straw and are solid thick quality. You can put them in the microwave to heat foods up. These dishes are also very easy to clean and can be put into the dishwasher with no worries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717wglrgylL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TGLIFEVER","source_asin":"B0BCL4MKD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCL4MKD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCL4MKD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":698974,"name":"ZenToes Luxury Bathroom Towel Warmer - XL Freestanding Bucket Style to Heat Towels, Robes, Pajamas, Blankets - Rapid Electric Heater with Auto Shut Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WYp9XiOLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury Bathroom Towel Warmer - Is there any better feeling than a warm towel at the end of a shower? Treat yourself to a spa day every day with this at-home luxurious bathroom towel warmer. Keep your towels toasty warm and ready to use after every shower for the ultimate pampering experience! Toasty Warm Towels with the Touch of a Button - Simply place your towels in the towel warmer and a single-touch control provides you with up to 60 minutes of warming time. Features an auto shut-off functionality for your safety. Ultra Large Capacity - The large bucket has the capacity to hold 3 large bath towels or a personal throw blanket. The bucket design ensures the items are evenly heated inside and out. Dimensions - 18.5 inch (H) x 13.25 inch (W) x 13.25 inch (D). Freestanding and Portable - Zentoes bucket style towel warmer is freestanding and portable so you can enjoy a warm towel or blanket anywhere in your home. Once you are finished warming your towels, the device can be easily stowed away. The towel warmer has a sleek design with a white exterior and wood-like accents. Our towel warmer is also ideal for professionals such as estheticians and massage therapists. With the ability to warm 10 hand towels or 24 washcloths, it is suitable for facials, shaves and massage, as well as nail salon, spa, restaurant and hotel use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WYp9XiOLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZenToes","source_asin":"B08MQMGLBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MQMGLBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MQMGLBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
